{"ticker":"GLW","updated":"2026-11-13T23:31:40Z","profile":{"longName":"Corning Incorporated","shortName":"Corning Incorporated","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"United States","website":"https://www.corning.com","fullTimeEmployees":67200,"marketCap":98268635136,"trailingPE":46.186234,"forwardPE":25.112377,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.5459476,"pegRatio":0.69,"targetMeanPrice":174.94444,"targetHighPrice":220.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.184,"earningsGrowth":0.56,"grossMargins":0.36481,"operatingMargins":0.16767,"profitMargins":0.12134,"totalRevenue":17718999040,"beta":1.225,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":271.78,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":77.39,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.94},"summary":"Corning Incorporated operates in optical communications, display, specialty materials, automotive, and life sciences businesses in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Japan, Taiwan, China, South Korea, Germany, and internationally. The company provides optical fibers and cables; and hardware and equipment products, such as cable assemblies, fiber optic hardware and connectors, optical components and couplers, closures, network interface devices, and other accessories for the telecommunications industry, businesses, governments, and individuals. It also offers glass substrates for flat panel displays, including liquid crystal displays and organic light-emitting diodes that are used in televisions, notebook computers, desktop monitors, tablets, and handheld devices. In addition, it manufactures products that offer material formulations for glass, glass ceramics, crystals, precision metrology instruments, and software, as well as glass wafers and substrates, tinted sunglasses, and radiation shielding products for markets, such as mobile consumer electronics, semiconductor equipment optics and consumables, aerospace and defense optics, radiation shielding products, sunglasses, and telecommunications components. Further, the company provides ceramic substrates and filter products for emissions control in mobile, gasoline, and diesel applications, as well as technical glass and optic ","summary_zh":"康寧公司在美國、加拿大、墨西哥、日本、台灣、中國、韓國、德國和國際上經營光通訊、顯示器、特殊材料、汽車和生命科學業務。本公司提供光纖、光纖；硬體和設備產品，例如電纜組件、光纖硬體和連接器、光學元件和耦合器、閉合件、網路介面設備以及電信業、企業、政府和個人的其他配件。它還提供用於平板顯示器的玻璃基板，包括用於電視、筆記型電腦、桌上型顯示器、平板電腦和手持設備的液晶顯示器和有機發光二極管。此外，該公司還生產為玻璃、玻璃陶瓷、晶體、精密計量儀器和軟體提供材料配方的產品，以及玻璃晶圓和基板、有色太陽眼鏡和輻射屏蔽產品，供行動消費性電子產品、半導體設備光學和消耗品、航空航天和國防光學、輻射屏蔽產品、太陽眼鏡和電信組件等市場使用。此外，該公司還提供用於移動、汽油和柴油應用中排放控制的陶瓷基材和過濾器產品，以及技術玻璃和光學產品","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電子元件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":77.75,"h":78.33,"l":76.78,"c":77.98,"v":8835100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":78.28,"h":78.81,"l":77.32,"c":78.7,"v":12936700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":78.42,"h":78.68,"l":76.15,"c":76.88,"v":10590700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":77.45,"h":79.65,"l":77.19,"c":79.62,"v":10372500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":79.62,"h":79.98,"l":78.57,"c":79.56,"v":10765000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":79.4,"h":79.84,"l":78.1,"c":79.16,"v":7314200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":79.2,"h":81.02,"l":79.02,"c":81.0,"v":8654200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":81.29,"h":81.58,"l":79.06,"c":79.91,"v":8648900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":78.08,"h":79.47,"l":77.05,"c":79.13,"v":8518700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":79.15,"h":79.48,"l":78.69,"c":79.35,"v":4484000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":79.9,"h":80.73,"l":79.6,"c":80.26,"v":8204600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":80.26,"h":82.21,"l":80.19,"c":82.03,"v":6300300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":81.46,"h":83.75,"l":80.88,"c":83.12,"v":9010000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":83.8,"h":84.35,"l":81.91,"c":82.52,"v":7207100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":83.03,"h":84.18,"l":82.61,"c":83.56,"v":7739200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":84.11,"h":86.1,"l":83.81,"c":85.34,"v":8678000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":85.47,"h":86.23,"l":83.81,"c":85.06,"v":6733000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":85.27,"h":87.07,"l":84.76,"c":87.07,"v":6088100},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":87.15,"h":87.75,"l":86.13,"c":87.19,"v":453